# llama3.1:8b with an explicit context window.
#
# `ollama serve` runs with no OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH here, so it defaults to 4096
# tokens and SILENTLY discards any prompt over that, oldest messages first — the
# system prompt and the operator's question go first. llama3.1 itself supports
# 131072 (llama.context_length); 16384 is what this machine can evaluate quickly
# (~960 tok/s prompt eval, ~2GB of KV cache) and comfortably holds the system
# prompt, the question, a capped tool result and a couple of tool rounds.
FROM llama3.1:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
